      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atwood%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Chester Atwood gained settlement rights by marrying Patsy Ann, a woman of the Choctaw Nation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atwood%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Chester Atwood was an educated farmer and extensive landowner who served as an elected commissioner of Hughes County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atwood%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
